# Caroogo CRM API Endpoints

This document contains reverse-engineered API endpoints from the Caroogo CRM for use in the AI wrapper.

## Global Config
- **Base URL:** `https://base44.app/api/apps/6900d8f18678d0668840afe5`
- **Headers Required:**
  - `Authorization`: `Bearer <token>`
  - `x-app-id`: `6900d8f18678d0668840afe5`
  - `Content-Type`: `application/json`

---

## Deal Management

> [!CAUTION]
> **Crucial Distinction: Create vs. Update**
> - Use **`POST`** ONLY when you want to generate a **brand new** deal record. 
> - Use **`PUT`** for **all subsequent changes** to an existing deal.
> - **Never repeat a `POST` request** to capture an ID; doing so will create duplicate deals in the CRM. If you lose an ID, use the `Fetch` (GET) endpoint to find it.

