### Fetch Existing Deal
**Endpoint:** `GET /entities/Deal?q={"id":"<deal_id>"}`

**Description:** Retrieves a single deal by its ID.

---

### Fetch Deal History/Logs
**Endpoint:** `GET /entities/DealHistory?q={"deal_id":"<deal_id>"}&sort=-created_date&limit=100`

---

### Check Duplicate Deal (Function)
**Endpoint:** `POST /functions/checkDuplicateDeal`
**(Note: Expected payload structure was not captured, but this function runs automatically when initiating a new deal)**

---

### Sync Deal to High Impact (Function)
**Endpoint:** `POST /functions/syncDealToHighImpact`
**(Note: Executed right after Deal creation)**

