## Messaging & Communication

### Send SMS (GoTo Function)
**Endpoint:** `POST /functions/gotoSendSMS`

**Description:** Sends an SMS message to the customer via GoTo integration.

**Request Payload:**
```json
{
  "to_number": "5024433892",
  "from_number": "5023713114",
  "message": "This is a test message from the caroogo wrapper exploration.",
  "deal_id": "699e993533be7d14b00ff343",
  "customer_name": "Test Tester"
}
```

### Send Email (Outlook/O365 Function)
**Endpoint:** `POST /functions/o365SendEmail`

**Description:** Sends an email to the customer using the user's connected Office 365 account.

**Request Payload:**
```json
{
  "to_email": "tniche7594@gmail.com",
  "subject": "Test Subject",
  "message": "Dear Test,\n\nThank you for choosing Bill Collins...\n",
  "deal_id": "699e993533be7d14b00ff343",
  "customer_name": "Test Tester"
}
```

### Update Deal

**Endpoint:** `PUT https://base44.app/api/apps/6900d8f18678d0668840afe5/entities/Deal/{deal_id}`

**Method:** `PUT`

**Action:** **MODIFY EXISTING RECORD**

> [!TIP]
> Use this endpoint for adding addresses, changing names, updating phone numbers, or any other metadata changes after the deal has been created.

**Request Payload:**
```json
{
  "buyer_first_name": "Test",
  "buyer_last_name": "Tester",
  "buyer_email": "tniche7594@gmail.com",
  "buyer_primary_phone": "5024433892",
  "buyer_address": "123 Main St",
  "buyer_city": "Louisville",
  "buyer_state": "KY",
  "buyer_zip": "40202",
  "deal_type": "phone",
  "dealership": "1",
  "status": "new",
  "lead_source": "phone_call_inbound",
  "customer_in_showroom": false
  // ... (Full entity state is sent, many fields are null or empty strings by default)
}
```

**Response:**
Returns the full updated deal object.

